<title>SPAIN: Spanish 3- and 10-year bond yields fall at auction.</title>
<headline>Spanish 3- and 10-year bond yields fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>3-year     5.660    5.896   102.05  100.85    348.822  159.522</p>
<p>10-year    6.898    7.047   102.40  100.70    227.614  115.312</p>
<p>	 --Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
